1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,370
1986. Romania.

2
00:00:02,370 --> 00:00:07,100
Workers drilling for a power plant break into a chamber
sealed for five and a half million years.

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:11,000
The air is poison. No light. Almost no oxygen.

4
00:00:11,370 --> 00:00:13,450
And yet — it's crawling with life.

5
00:00:13,790 --> 00:00:17,230
Blind spiders. White leeches. An eyeless scorpion.

6
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:23,980
Thirty-seven species found nowhere else on Earth —
living off bacteria that eat toxic gas instead of sunlight.

7
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:29,720
NASA studies this cave. Because if life works down here...
it works on other worlds.

8
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:34,570
Barely a hundred humans have ever been inside.
The door stays locked.
